I've implemented the node as declared, importing only `inference-llm`. I did not add the `http-client` import or the enrichment fetch. The node's declared capabilities are only `LLMClient<inference>`, and the graph definition doesn't yet grant HTTP. Sending each item's untrusted text to an external URL would be an undeclared egress path, and it would be invisible in the graph. If the grant is approved and the graph is updated, the fetch can be added then.

